  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the dissolved miso paste, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the soaked sevaiiya and stir to coat with the miso-marinate.",
    "Cook for 5-7 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the sevaiiya is lightly toasted and fluffy.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley, if desired.",
